[{"id":7,"slug":"a-wedding-at-a-lighthouse","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/photo-test/2026/10/a-wedding-at-a-lighthouse/","date_gmt":"2026-10-12T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A wedding at a lighthouse"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>This is a test post made for checking image-heavy imports. It tells a made-up story of a small wedding at a lighthouse, and the fifty pictures are public domain photographs of lighthouses from around the world.</p>\n<p>The ceremony was set for four in the afternoon, on the lawn below the tower. By noon the wind had dropped and the sea went the colour of slate.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-01.jpg\" alt=\"Avonmouth lighthouse 1891\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>1. Avonmouth lighthouse 1891</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-02.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse Chania evening sun\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>2. Lighthouse Chania evening sun</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-03.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse, harbor Saint-Martin-de-Ré, Ré island, Charente-Maritime, France\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>3. Lighthouse, harbor Saint-Martin-de-Ré, Ré island, Charente-Maritime, France</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-04.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse at Irizaki up Close\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>4. Lighthouse at Irizaki up Close</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-05.jpg\" alt=\"ChicagoHarborLighthouseJuly2019\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>5. ChicagoHarborLighthouseJuly2019</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The guests came up the path in twos and threes. Someone had put out folding chairs in rows, and a boy ran along the back row counting them aloud.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-06.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse Zadar\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>6. Lighthouse Zadar</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-07.jpg\" alt=\"Belle Tout Lighthouse, June 2020 01\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>7. Belle Tout Lighthouse, June 2020 01</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-08.jpg\" alt=\"Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Tip\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>8. Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Tip</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-09.jpg\" alt=\"Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Sargassum\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>9. Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Sargassum</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-10.jpg\" alt=\"Champlain Lighthouse Crown Point\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>10. Champlain Lighthouse Crown Point</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The vows</h2>\n<p>Nobody read from a card. Each of them said four sentences, the second one a joke, and the whole lawn laughed before the sea took the sound away.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-11.jpg\" alt=\"Royal Sovereign Lighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>11. Royal Sovereign Lighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-12.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse in Jeju Island\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>12. Lighthouse in Jeju Island</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-13.jpg\" alt=\"Red lighthouse in Sokcho\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>13. Red lighthouse in Sokcho</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-14.jpg\" alt=\"Pointe aux Barques Lighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>14. Pointe aux Barques Lighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-15.jpg\" alt=\"Cape Disappointment Lighthouse, in Washington State\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>15. Cape Disappointment Lighthouse, in Washington State</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After the ceremony the light on the tower came on early, a test of the lamp, and everyone agreed it had been planned.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-16.jpg\" alt=\"Tsurugisaki Lighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>16. Tsurugisaki Lighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-17.jpg\" alt=\"Crookhaven Heads Lighthouse 2025\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>17. Crookhaven Heads Lighthouse 2025</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-18.jpg\" alt=\"Akranes lighthouse 2018\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>18. Akranes lighthouse 2018</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-19.jpg\" alt=\"El Encanto Lighthouse (Cabo San Lucas)\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>19. El Encanto Lighthouse (Cabo San Lucas)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-20.jpg\" alt=\"250821 Inubosaki Lighthouse 06\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>20. 250821 Inubosaki Lighthouse 06</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Dinner was fish and bread at long tables. The photographer walked the edges of the room with one lens and never sat down.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-21.jpg\" alt=\"250821 Inubosaki Lighthouse 05\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>21. 250821 Inubosaki Lighthouse 05</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-22.jpg\" alt=\"20220123 TagilLighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>22. 20220123 TagilLighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-23.jpg\" alt=\"Ocracoke Lighthouse in Ocracoke NC\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>23. Ocracoke Lighthouse in Ocracoke NC</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-24.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse at Kovalam Beach, Thiruvananthapuram\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>24. Lighthouse at Kovalam Beach, Thiruvananthapuram</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-25.jpg\" alt=\"Cape du Couedic lighthouse at sunset\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>25. Cape du Couedic lighthouse at sunset</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The long evening</h2>\n<p>When the sky turned orange there was a short speech, a long silence and then music from a borrowed speaker.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-26.jpg\" alt=\"Currituck lighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>26. Currituck lighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-27.jpg\" alt=\"Storozhno lighthouse stairs\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>27. Storozhno lighthouse stairs</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-28.jpg\" alt=\"Fenwick island lighthouse 2 043\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>28. Fenwick island lighthouse 2 043</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-29.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse acre\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>29. Lighthouse acre</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-30.jpg\" alt=\"Slettnes lighthouse 03\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>30. Slettnes lighthouse 03</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Children fell asleep under the tables. Their shoes were lined up by the door, sand still in the laces.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-31.jpg\" alt=\"Slettnes lighthouse 05\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>31. Slettnes lighthouse 05</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-32.jpg\" alt=\"Stuart Island Lighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>32. Stuart Island Lighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-33.jpg\" alt=\"View from Kõpu lighthouse\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>33. View from Kõpu lighthouse</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-34.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse Promthep Cape 01\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>34. Lighthouse Promthep Cape 01</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-35.jpg\" alt=\"Lighthouse Promthep Cape 02\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>35. Lighthouse Promthep Cape 02</figcaption></figure>\n<p>At ten the lamp swung round for real. A last group walked out along the breakwater to watch it sweep the water.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-36.jpg\" alt=\"Burry Port Lighthouse, Carmarthenshire, Wales\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>36. Burry Port Lighthouse, Carmarthenshire, Wales</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-37.jpg\" alt=\"Inubosaki Lighthouse 01\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>37. Inubosaki Lighthouse 01</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-38.jpg\" alt=\"Vorontsov Lighthouse 2017 G1\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>38. Vorontsov Lighthouse 2017 G1</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-39.jpg\" alt=\"Vorontsov Lighthouse 2017 G2\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>39. Vorontsov Lighthouse 2017 G2</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-40.jpg\" alt=\"Arkitsa lighthouse (2018)\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>40. Arkitsa lighthouse (2018)</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Back at the house, the leftover bread went into a bag and the chairs went back into the van, folded flat.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-41.jpg\" alt=\"Stairs in Biarritz lighthouse 1\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>41. Stairs in Biarritz lighthouse 1</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-42.jpg\" alt=\"Goat Island Lighthouse 1859 tower\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>42. Goat Island Lighthouse 1859 tower</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-43.jpg\" alt=\"Sakonnet Lighthouse RI 2\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>43. Sakonnet Lighthouse RI 2</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-44.jpg\" alt=\"Mile Rocks Lighthouse 1962\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>44. Mile Rocks Lighthouse 1962</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-45.jpg\" alt=\"Ardnamurchan Lighthouse about 1851 1\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>45. Ardnamurchan Lighthouse about 1851 1</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The next morning the lawn showed only a few pressed circles in the grass where the chairs had been.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-46.jpg\" alt=\"Ardnamurchan Lighthouse about 1851 2\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>46. Ardnamurchan Lighthouse about 1851 2</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-47.jpg\" alt=\"Portland Head Lighthouse in October\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>47. Portland Head Lighthouse in October</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-48.jpg\" alt=\"Yaquina Head Lighthouse 2007\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>48. Yaquina Head Lighthouse 2007</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-49.jpg\" alt=\"The Whiteford Lighthouse (Unsplash)\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>49. The Whiteford Lighthouse (Unsplash)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-50.jpg\" alt=\"Coast Lighthouse Architecture\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>50. Coast Lighthouse Architecture</figcaption></figure>\n<p>That is the day in fifty frames. Thank you for scrolling all the way down.</p>\n<h2>Photo credits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Avonmouth_lighthouse_1891.jpg\">Avonmouth lighthouse 1891</a>, Samuel Loxton, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_Chania_evening_sun.jpg\">Lighthouse Chania evening sun</a>, Jebulon, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse,_harbor_Saint-Martin-de-R%C3%A9,_R%C3%A9_island,_Charente-Maritime,_France.jpg\">Lighthouse, harbor Saint-Martin-de-Ré, Ré island, Charente-Maritime, France</a>, Jebulon, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_at_Irizaki_up_Close.jpg\">Lighthouse at Irizaki up Close</a>, Melkov, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ChicagoHarborLighthouseJuly2019.jpg\">ChicagoHarborLighthouseJuly2019</a>, JohnDziak, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_Zadar.jpg\">Lighthouse Zadar</a>, Not defined, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Belle_Tout_Lighthouse,_June_2020_01.jpg\">Belle Tout Lighthouse, June 2020 01</a>, Poliphilo, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Tip.jpg\">Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Tip</a>, BrickLightning, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Sargassum.jpg\">Punta-Tuna-Lighthouse-Sargassum</a>, BrickLightning, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Champlain_Lighthouse_Crown_Point.jpg\">Champlain Lighthouse Crown Point</a>, Alex Scrodin, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Royal_Sovereign_Lighthouse.jpg\">Royal Sovereign Lighthouse</a>, Alexis Markwick, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_in_Jeju_Island.jpg\">Lighthouse in Jeju Island</a>, Bernard Gagnon, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_lighthouse_in_Sokcho.jpg\">Red lighthouse in Sokcho</a>, Bernard Gagnon, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pointe_aux_Barques_Lighthouse.jpg\">Pointe aux Barques Lighthouse</a>, Stickvaughn, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cape_Disappointment_Lighthouse,_in_Washington_State.jpg\">Cape Disappointment Lighthouse, in Washington State</a>, Rogars, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tsurugisaki_Lighthouse.jpg\">Tsurugisaki Lighthouse</a>, Enden nix, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crookhaven_Heads_Lighthouse_2025.jpg\">Crookhaven Heads Lighthouse 2025</a>, Pencilceaser123, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Akranes_lighthouse_2018.jpg\">Akranes lighthouse 2018</a>, DimaXmarxist, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:El_Encanto_Lighthouse_(Cabo_San_Lucas).jpg\">El Encanto Lighthouse (Cabo San Lucas)</a>, Alexis Doine, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:250821_Inubosaki_Lighthouse_06.jpg\">250821 Inubosaki Lighthouse 06</a>, Aspere, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:250821_Inubosaki_Lighthouse_05.jpg\">250821 Inubosaki Lighthouse 05</a>, Aspere, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20220123_TagilLighthouse.jpg\">20220123 TagilLighthouse</a>, MSDN.WhiteKnight, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ocracoke_Lighthouse_in_Ocracoke_NC.jpg\">Ocracoke Lighthouse in Ocracoke NC</a>, Progress P, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_at_Kovalam_Beach,_Thiruvananthapuram.jpg\">Lighthouse at Kovalam Beach, Thiruvananthapuram</a>, Amitbalani, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cape_du_Couedic_lighthouse_at_sunset.jpg\">Cape du Couedic lighthouse at sunset</a>, Hugh Mason, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Currituck_lighthouse.jpg\">Currituck lighthouse</a>, Warfieldian, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Storozhno_lighthouse_stairs.JPG\">Storozhno lighthouse stairs</a>, Евгений Адаев, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fenwick_island_lighthouse_2_043.jpg\">Fenwick island lighthouse 2 043</a>, L Schwartz, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_acre.jpg\">Lighthouse acre</a>, Almog, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Slettnes_lighthouse_03.jpg\">Slettnes lighthouse 03</a>, Rünno, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Slettnes_lighthouse_05.jpg\">Slettnes lighthouse 05</a>, Rünno, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stuart_Island_Lighthouse.jpg\">Stuart Island Lighthouse</a>, Farwestern Photo by Gregg M. Erickson, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_from_K%C3%B5pu_lighthouse.jpg\">View from Kõpu lighthouse</a>, Hannu, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_Promthep_Cape_01.jpg\">Lighthouse Promthep Cape 01</a>, ADwarf, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lighthouse_Promthep_Cape_02.jpg\">Lighthouse Promthep Cape 02</a>, ADwarf, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Burry_Port_Lighthouse,_Carmarthenshire,_Wales.jpg\">Burry Port Lighthouse, Carmarthenshire, Wales</a>, Vouliagmeni, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Inubosaki_Lighthouse_01.JPG\">Inubosaki Lighthouse 01</a>, Abasaa, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vorontsov_Lighthouse_2017_G1.jpg\">Vorontsov Lighthouse 2017 G1</a>, George Chernilevsky, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vorontsov_Lighthouse_2017_G2.jpg\">Vorontsov Lighthouse 2017 G2</a>, George Chernilevsky, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Arkitsa_lighthouse_(2018).jpeg\">Arkitsa lighthouse (2018)</a>, Άργος, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stairs_in_Biarritz_lighthouse_1.jpg\">Stairs in Biarritz lighthouse 1</a>, Tangopaso, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Goat_Island_Lighthouse_1859_tower.JPG\">Goat Island Lighthouse 1859 tower</a>, US Coast Guard, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sakonnet_Lighthouse_RI_2.jpg\">Sakonnet Lighthouse RI 2</a>, U.S. Coast Guard, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mile_Rocks_Lighthouse_1962.jpg\">Mile Rocks Lighthouse 1962</a>, Unknown author, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ardnamurchan_Lighthouse_about_1851_1.jpg\">Ardnamurchan Lighthouse about 1851 1</a>, Hydrographic Office of the Admiralty, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ardnamurchan_Lighthouse_about_1851_2.jpg\">Ardnamurchan Lighthouse about 1851 2</a>, Hydrographic Office of the Admiralty, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Portland_Head_Lighthouse_in_October.jpeg\">Portland Head Lighthouse in October</a>, JaqNotJill, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yaquina_Head_Lighthouse_2007.jpg\">Yaquina Head Lighthouse 2007</a>, Davgood Kirshot, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Whiteford_Lighthouse_(Unsplash).jpg\">The Whiteford Lighthouse (Unsplash)</a>, Alfonso Ninguno alfonso_ninguno, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coast_Lighthouse_Architecture.jpg\">Coast Lighthouse Architecture</a>, Holly's Coastal View, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kuro_Island_(Kuroshima),_Kuroshima_Lighthouse_Beach.jpg\">Kuro Island (Kuroshima), Kuroshima Lighthouse Beach</a>, AsPJT, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A made-up wedding day at a lighthouse in fifty pictures, written to test image-heavy imports."},"author":6,"categories":[1],"tags":[4,5],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p1-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":6,"name":"Photo Test","slug":"phototest"}]}},{"id":8,"slug":"a-windy-weekend-on-the-coast","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/photo-test/2026/09/a-windy-weekend-on-the-coast/","date_gmt":"2026-09-20T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A windy weekend on the coast"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>A shorter test post with twelve pictures, about a walk along a stretch of coast one windy weekend.</p>\n<p>We started at the harbour at nine and followed the shore path north, stopping whenever the light changed.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-01.jpg\" alt=\"Fort William at Cape Coast\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>1. Fort William at Cape Coast</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-02.jpg\" alt=\"Lane - Sailing Ships off the New England Coast - HNT\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>2. Lane - Sailing Ships off the New England Coast - HNT</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-03.jpg\" alt=\"Beautiful Sea Cliff, Long Island, WPA poster, 1939\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>3. Beautiful Sea Cliff, Long Island, WPA poster, 1939</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-04.jpg\" alt=\"1873 Beers Map of Sea Cliff Grove,Long Island, New York - Geographicus - SeaCliffGrove-beers-1873\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>4. 1873 Beers Map of Sea Cliff Grove,Long Island, New York - Geographicus - SeaCliffGrove-beers-1873</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The first hour was all rock pools and wet stone. The tide was going out and the gulls followed it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-05.jpg\" alt=\"Gauguin, Paul - The Flageolet Player on the Cliff - Google Art Project\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>5. Gauguin, Paul - The Flageolet Player on the Cliff - Google Art Project</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-06.jpg\" alt=\"Eroding sea cliffs\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>6. Eroding sea cliffs</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-07.jpg\" alt=\"Just one long step to Sea Cliff, L.I LCCN98514124\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>7. Just one long step to Sea Cliff, L.I LCCN98514124</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-08.jpg\" alt=\"Eagle Cliff, Manchester-by-the-Sea by James Fairman\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>8. Eagle Cliff, Manchester-by-the-Sea by James Fairman</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Along the cliffs</h2>\n<p>The path climbed. Every turn showed another bay, another small beach, another boat pulled up on the sand.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-09.jpg\" alt=\"Seal Rocks, Cliff House\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>9. Seal Rocks, Cliff House</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-10.jpg\" alt=\"Outlook from forest over cliffed Baltic Sea coast\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>10. Outlook from forest over cliffed Baltic Sea coast</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-11.jpg\" alt=\"Flight Over Sea Cliff Bridge (Unsplash)\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>11. Flight Over Sea Cliff Bridge (Unsplash)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-12.jpg\" alt=\"Sea Cliff, Cape Arkona, 2018\" width=\"1600\"><figcaption>12. Sea Cliff, Cape Arkona, 2018</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We caught the last bus back with sandy boots and a full memory card.</p>\n<h2>Photo credits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fort_William_at_Cape_Coast.jpg\">Fort William at Cape Coast</a>, Kwameghana, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lane_-_Sailing_Ships_off_the_New_England_Coast_-_HNT.jpg\">Lane - Sailing Ships off the New England Coast - HNT</a>, Fitz Henry Lane, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beautiful_Sea_Cliff,_Long_Island,_WPA_poster,_1939.jpg\">Beautiful Sea Cliff, Long Island, WPA poster, 1939</a>, WPA Federal Art Project, Dis. 4, New York, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1873_Beers_Map_of_Sea_Cliff_Grove,Long_Island,_New_York_-_Geographicus_-_SeaCliffGrove-beers-1873.jpg\">1873 Beers Map of Sea Cliff Grove,Long Island, New York - Geographicus - SeaCliffGrove-beers-1873</a>, http://www.geographicus.com/mm5/cartographers/beers.txt, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gauguin,_Paul_-_The_Flageolet_Player_on_the_Cliff_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg\">Gauguin, Paul - The Flageolet Player on the Cliff - Google Art Project</a>, Paul Gauguin, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eroding_sea_cliffs.jpg\">Eroding sea cliffs</a>, U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Just_one_long_step_to_Sea_Cliff,_L.I_LCCN98514124.jpg\">Just one long step to Sea Cliff, L.I LCCN98514124</a>, Work Projects Administration Poster Collection, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eagle_Cliff,_Manchester-by-the-Sea_by_James_Fairman.jpg\">Eagle Cliff, Manchester-by-the-Sea by James Fairman</a>, James Fairman, Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seal_Rocks,_Cliff_House.jpg\">Seal Rocks, Cliff House</a>, Britton &amp;amp; Rey, San Francisco. ca. 1908., Public domain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Outlook_from_forest_over_cliffed_Baltic_Sea_coast.JPG\">Outlook from forest over cliffed Baltic Sea coast</a>, Cartoffel, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flight_Over_Sea_Cliff_Bridge_(Unsplash).jpg\">Flight Over Sea Cliff Bridge (Unsplash)</a>, Benjamin Punzalan benjaminpunzalan, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sea_Cliff,_Cape_Arkona,_2018.jpg\">Sea Cliff, Cape Arkona, 2018</a>, Kawon Kez Sel, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saltburn_Cliff_Lift,_Lower_Promenade,_Saltburn-by-the-Sea_(April_2016)_(11).jpg\">Saltburn Cliff Lift, Lower Promenade, Saltburn-by-the-Sea (April 2016) (11)</a>, User:Hassocks5489, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A coastal walk in twelve pictures, written to test posts with a medium number of images."},"author":6,"categories":[2],"tags":[5],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/photo-test/p2-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":6,"name":"Photo Test","slug":"phototest"}]}},{"id":9,"slug":"what-goes-in-the-bag-on-a-shoot-day","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/photo-test/2026/08/what-goes-in-the-bag-on-a-shoot-day/","date_gmt":"2026-08-30T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"What goes in the bag on a shoot day"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>A text-only post with no images and no featured image, to check that a blog with plain posts next to the heavy ones imports as usual.</p>\n<p>Packing for a shoot day is mostly deciding what to leave at home. Two bodies, three lenses, a lens cloth, spare batteries, a bottle of water.</p>\n<p>The rest is waiting for good light. Some days it arrives at seven, some days it does not arrive at all, and a list of what to try next is worth more than a new lens.</p>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A short text-only post about packing for a shoot day."},"author":6,"categories":[3],"tags":[],"_embedded":{"author":[{"id":6,"name":"Photo Test","slug":"phototest"}]}}]